11:      jg-key        #1b2740   keycap face
12:      jg-flag       #ff6a4d   guard flag warning
13:      jg-ok         #35d0ae   verified receipt
14: 
15:    Keyboard focus comes from the global focus-visible rule in
16:    src/index.css, so every button this file renders shows a visible
17:    outline without a local override. Motion is gated behind
18:    prefers-reduced-motion: no-preference, matching the repo pattern.
